<title>USA: Mikasa sets initial qtly div at $0.05/shr.</title>
<headline>Mikasa sets initial qtly div at $0.05/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, Calif. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikasa Inc said Tuesday its board had authorized the initiation of a regular quarterly dividend at $0.05 per share, payable April 18, record on April 4.</p>
<p>Raymond Dingman, president and chief executive, said the move was made because of the company's &quot;strong financial position and cash flow.&quot;</p>
</text>
